            GPOPLE(3+IJ)=+( RD4(4))+( RD3(4,8))*AQC( 5)
            GPOPLE(4+IJ)=+( RD4(5))+( RD3(5,8))*AQC( 5) &
                         +( RD3(2,7))*AQC( 6) &
